\text{wake}
).

That creates trail infrastructure.

Future imps reaching the same junction don’t merely see:

Turn left.

They see:

Left previously exposed K, right produced Q, another traveler found a failure here, and this route only worked after changing basis.

So the Metamap gains signposts without becoming railroaded by them.

Forgiveness keeps every sign provisional.

